# ============================================================
# legalesq.com — 301 redirects from old WordPress URLs
# Place this file at the repo root. Cloudflare Pages reads it
# automatically on deploy. Rules are evaluated top to bottom;
# the first match wins, so order matters (specific -> general).
#
# IMPORTANT: Cloudflare Pages only applies the FIRST 100 rules in
# this file and SILENTLY DROPS the rest. Keep the total number of
# rule lines (non-comment, non-blank) at or under 100. This file is
# currently well under that. If you add rules and pass 100, the
# ones at the bottom will stop working with no error.
# ============================================================

